{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20455","headline":"和裴司空以诗请刑部白侍郎双鹤 · 张籍","name":"和裴司空以诗请刑部白侍郎双鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎皎仙家鹤，远留闲宅中。\n徘徊幽树月，嘹唳小亭风。\n丞相西园好，池塘野水通。\n欲将来放此，赏望与宾同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}